VERSION 2
RULE baseline.cpp.core.potential_memory_leak_use_of_new_without_delete VERSION 1
IN FILE
WHEN TEXT_MATCHES "\\bnew\\s+\\w+(?![^<>]*\\s*>)" "im"
WHEN TEXT_MISSING "free\\s*\\(|delete\\s+|unique_ptr|shared_ptr|RAII" "im"
REPORT "Potential Memory Leak: Use of `new` Without `delete`"
SEVERITY INFO
CONFIDENCE LOW
WITH TRACE
